{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1488.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e94f34cd92a02e190ad99b59ba306a6b5fe94175346c2513f7fbb5ace6cb4d37","ja":"……で、公演の打ち上げに、劇場のみんなが\n加わって大騒ぎだったんですよ♪　ね、雪歩？","zh":"……然后，剧场的大家都加入到了\n演出的庆功宴里，可热闹了呢♪　对吧，雪步？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1488.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"983361c164c257c04b71a738ae517560189065a7aad4f4ca326d937daa7670b8","ja":"えっ……？\nあっ。ええっと……。","zh":"诶……？\n啊。那个……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1488.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"07b8d5af5af6b2ec03ecad249300878496fac4367b1c02a9daace9ad72ba1ce1","ja":"雪歩も楽しそうでしたね。\nどりんくばーで、様々なじゅーすを混ぜたりなど。","zh":"雪步也很开心的样子呢。\n在饮料吧把各种果汁调配在一起之类的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1488.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"16f9567b685964c4bfe4ce477d8b2a0c5a4be85390c5332ed3e4981406896cc1","ja":"はうっ！　あ、あのときは、\nみんなにつられて、つい……。","zh":"哇！那、那个时候，\n我被大家感染，不知不觉就……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1488.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1d1078f6770b9ecfa1fbe790583c5c60ad5cf18e272d6516b398def497a151ea","ja":"亜美と真美のいたずらで、面妖な飲み物が\n完成したときは、どうしたものかと思いました。","zh":"亚美和真美的恶作剧做出怪异的饮料时，\n我真不知道该怎么办才好。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1488.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"ddaec338876b2480137121444b4d028f7eb723bc0875d2f41790f969ff6bd893","ja":"結局、律子さんに怒られて、\n自分たちで飲むことになってたよね。","zh":"结果被律子小姐训了一通，\n变成由我们自己喝掉了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1488.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"5500508164c8b705128a617a187bcc86df40f019c9fb0bc15cf2a69a746ceb28","ja":"にひひっ♪　あれはふたりの自業自得よ。\n自分の作ったものには、責任を取らなくちゃ♪","zh":"嘿嘿♪ 那是她们两个自作自受啦。\n自己做出来的东西，就得负起责任来才行嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1488.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"bb1f4a202ec5499913758817eb0e605156c619dd0e7527cf1115abe7ea77bd57","ja":"「いやー、とっても楽しそうですね！\n天海さん、他にはどんなことがありました？」","zh":"“哎呀，听起来真开心呢！\n天海小姐，除此之外还发生了什么事吗？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1488.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"21d60b2ce9ccbdcd9c8ded8af827bc937d7c4171d2c62d5321acf0adfd08cb8c","ja":"…………え？\nあっ、えーっと……ですね……！","zh":"…………咦？\n啊，那个……其实……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1488.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"367dbb5e54ba269cd105dc642c15133c221f62c9c314f25d4d12b425a27e4a3d","ja":"打ち上げのときは、色々ありましたので。\nどれから話せばいいか迷ってしまいますね、春香？","zh":"庆功宴的时候发生了很多事。\n我都不知道该从哪件说起了呢，春香？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1488.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"d689d9ae8c1bd0ae4e22c94afb1c2c3c59f074982879d8a58e41dc2ed8b39c69","ja":"そ、そうなんですよ！　えっと、何のお話を\nしようかなぁ……。そうだ、その後に真が……。","zh":"是、是这样的！呃，该聊点什么\n好呢……对了，后来真她……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
